 "adaptation_rules": [
  "rows share one dimension + one unit (structural): a value cannot be placed in a row of another unit",
  "no approved evidence -> neutral side-by-side: identical column styling, no ticks/crosses/winner, basis chip 'not a tested comparison' always visible",
  "requested evidence comparison without evidence -> blocked structure preview (slots + required fields, no values)",
  "every value needs fact_id (template throws otherwise)",
  "converted value inline; if it doesn't fit the column it drops to its own line",
  "columns <400px use the compact value size (64px)",
  "density: portrait max 3 rows, square/landscape max 4; more -> second image",
  "landscape (W/H>1.15): subjects stacked left, table right with short column headers",
  "subject images at equal display size + 'not to scale' note unless scale_calibrated"
 ],
